   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="1907_AS_RBH_1_00032" />
                  <hi rend="latintype">Dr. Richard</hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <hi rend="latintype">Beer-Hofmann</hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs ref="#pmb68" type="place">Wien XVIII</rs>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb235251">
                     <hi rend="latintype">Hasenauerstr</hi> 59</rs>. </addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="image">
            <p rend="center">
               <pb facs="1907_AS_RBH_1_00031" />
               <hi rend="pre-print">
                  <rs ref="#pmb723" type="place">Wildbad Waldbrunn</rs> bei <rs ref="#pmb428" type="place">Welsberg</rs> im <rs type="place" ref="#pmb724">Pustertale</rs>.</hi>
            </p>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline rend="right">
                  <pb facs="1907_AS_RBH_1_00032" />
                  <date when="1907-08-19">19. 8. 907</date>
               </dateline>
            </opener>
            <p>
               <salute>lieber Richard;</salute> wir bleiben hier bis <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L01700-1" />
               <date>26.</date>
               (<date>27.</date>. <date>28</date>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L01700-1">
                  <rs type="person" ref="#pmb2121">Schnitzler</rs> hielt sich noch bis <ref type="schnitzler-tagebuch" target="1907-08-26" subtype="date-only" /> im <rs type="place" ref="#pmb723">Wildbad Waldbrunn</rs> auf.</note>)?; (<date>Donnerſtag</date> ko<c rendition="#gemination-m" />t vielleicht <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L01700-2" />
               <rs ref="#pmb11485" type="person">Goldmann</rs>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L01700-2">Zu einem Zusammentreffen
                  mit <rs type="person" ref="#pmb11485">Goldmann</rs> kam es nicht, <ref type="schnitzler-briefe" target="L01702" subtype="cf" />.</note>) da<c rendition="#gemination-n" />
               <space unit="chars" quantity="1" />
               <rs ref="#pmb40120" type="place">Dolomitenſtraße</rs> (wahrſcheinlich <rs ref="#pmb40350" type="place">Grödner Thal</rs> – <rs ref="#pmb40346" type="place">Grödner Joch</rs>
               <space unit="chars" quantity="1" />
               <supplied>–</supplied>
               <space unit="chars" quantity="1" />
               <rs ref="#pmb40369" type="place">Pordoj</rs> – <rs ref="#pmb40362" type="place">Vigo</rs> – <rs ref="#pmb40371" type="place">Karerſee</rs>, – <rs ref="#pmb40260" type="place">Bozen</rs>.) da<c rendition="#gemination-n" />
               <space unit="chars" quantity="1" />
               <rs ref="#pmb43520" type="place">Meran</rs>, eventuell <rs ref="#pmb39975" type="place">Gardaſee</rs>, zurück zwiſchen <date>5</date> u. <date>10</date>, mit
               event. Aufenthalt (<rs ref="#pmb867" type="place">I<c rendition="#gemination-n" />sbruck</rs>, <rs ref="#pmb30" type="place">Salzburg</rs>.) Auf Wiederſehen
               hoffentlich.</p>
            <closer>Herzlichſt Ihr<lb />
               <signed>A.</signed>
            </closer>
            <postscript>
               <p>Schreiben Sie ein Wort! Viele Grüße über die Lande.</p>
            </postscript>
         </div>
      </body>
